{"2834630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unyverse", "steam_appid": 2834630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Included in PC Gamer's PC Gaming Show 12/4/25</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/1b6434bf4246b9e6a6d1332b5bbc9d11.avif?t=1787230500\" width=554 height=324 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Selected By Insider Gaming</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/674e47b9c6e5106780f96e9bb20c7d73.avif?t=1787230500\" width=430 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch Unyverse on the The Insider Gaming Showcase  on May 28 at 12 PM PT / 2 PM CT / 3 PM ET / 8 PM BST.</strong></p></p><br><h1>Hand to hand combat is feeling like a fighting game</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/bbb1d733bee780e4fcf9e3fef0437159.avif?t=1787230500\" width=866 height=499 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Over 175000 possible move combinations  in our combat system, that lets you fully customize like UFC but easily playable. So you can mix hand-to-hand, heavy weapon and spear in shield as well as sync powers. Our combat is built around the possible combinations. Experiment linking combos like a fighting game or find your sweet spot and never change.&quot;  -Founder Crandon Dillard on Instagram </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>Unyverse Selected for Mundo Network Indie Showcase</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/2dcb68997a5b6ed680e42f5186ae4a9e.avif?t=1787230500\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras_big/2dcb68997a5b6ed680e42f5186ae4a9e.webp?t=1787230500 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/b7b891536ac87a79415de725008e3f24.avif?t=1787230500\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras_big/b7b891536ac87a79415de725008e3f24.avif?t=1787230500 width=800 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Afrofuturistic Sci-Fi Action RPG Where Your Fists, Choices, and Inner Power Change the Fate of a Galaxy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unyverse is a sci-fi action RPG that fuses story-driven role-playing with the kinetic intensity of fighting games.</strong> Created by Afrime Studios, Unyverse invites players into a vibrant Afrofuturistic world where your fists, blades, and choices shape the fate of entire factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a D'zola Warrior, your journey will challenge you to fight, trade, and navigate a living world filled with moral complexity, kinetic action, and untold mysteries. Unyverse delivers an experience unlike any RPG before it—where every decision and every battle writes your legend in the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/32f57f6ac6493622f4016009cbfa4656.poster.avif?t=1787230500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/32f57f6ac6493622f4016009cbfa4656.webm?t=1787230500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/32f57f6ac6493622f4016009cbfa4656.mp4?t=1787230500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Afrofuturism Reimagined:</strong><br>Explore a stunning sci-fi world inspired by the African diaspora, where culture, myth, and advanced technology collide in ways never seen in games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/51ca320ed0985b6e13ccd48944e3ae8b.poster.avif?t=1787230500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/51ca320ed0985b6e13ccd48944e3ae8b.webm?t=1787230500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/51ca320ed0985b6e13ccd48944e3ae8b.mp4?t=1787230500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kinetic Fighting Game Combat:</strong><br>Master fast, fluid melee combat inspired by fighting games—string combos, counter foes, and unleash devastating finishers in real-time action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/2cfd609105329a3974c369fd2289715a.poster.avif?t=1787230500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/2cfd609105329a3974c369fd2289715a.webm?t=1787230500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/2cfd609105329a3974c369fd2289715a.mp4?t=1787230500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven RPG Systems:</strong><br>Shape your story through morally complex decisions that impact factions, alliances, and your standing across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/8ff9bd2347b0fdfa323fc67176167454.poster.avif?t=1787230500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/8ff9bd2347b0fdfa323fc67176167454.webm?t=1787230500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/8ff9bd2347b0fdfa323fc67176167454.mp4?t=1787230500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your D'Zola Warrior:</strong>  <br>Take on the role of a <strong>D'Zola</strong>, an elite warrior whose powers could save or doom their home planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/2cfd609105329a3974c369fd2289715a.poster.avif?t=1787230500\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/2cfd609105329a3974c369fd2289715a.webm?t=1787230500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/2cfd609105329a3974c369fd2289715a.mp4?t=1787230500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeroam Afrofuturistic Biomes</strong><br>Discover vast, living regions filled with side quests, rare resources, exotic creatures, and opportunities to trade, hunt, and build your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/951c2975c13d8c88533736d48a9d0267.poster.avif?t=1787230500\" width=1170 height=878 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/951c2975c13d8c88533736d48a9d0267.webm?t=1787230500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/951c2975c13d8c88533736d48a9d0267.mp4?t=1787230500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras/b7b891536ac87a79415de725008e3f24.avif?t=1787230500\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834630/extras_big/b7b891536ac87a79415de725008e3f24.avif?t=1787230500 width=800 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Afrofuturistic Sci-Fi Action RPG Where Your Fists, Choices, and Inner Power Change the Fate of a Galaxy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unyverse is a sci-fi action RPG that fuses story-driven role-playing with the kinetic intensity of fighting games.</strong> Created by Afrime Studios, Unyverse invites players into a vibrant Afrofuturistic world where your fists, blades, and choices shape the fate of entire factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a D'zola Warrior, your journey will challenge you to fight, trade, and navigate a living world filled with moral complexity, kinetic action, and untold mysteries. Unyverse delivers an experience unlike any RPG before it—where every decision and every battle writes your legend in the stars.</p><p c